kudos is a HOBBY operating system. It is not a product, is not certified or
qualified for any purpose, and is not offered as fit for safety-critical,
life-critical, or otherwise regulated use. It is built around AI agents that
generate their own applications just in time: the agent writes Zig, an external
build service compiles it off-target into a loadable module (the system carries
no compiler), and the kernel verifies and runs it — with OpenGL rendering as the
use case the whole machine is shaped around. See the Apache-2.0 warranty
disclaimer below, which applies in full.

